      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Tsuwei, system/core/include/private/android_filesystem_config.h defines these gid numbers, and 1021 is GPS.  That is the only one that is dedicated for GPS / Location features.  Without this gid, system_server process is unable to access system resources that are limited only gps.  We have no problem accessing modem because system_server has radio gid, but there is obviously a co-incidence.  Other resources include sockets for IPC, process launch configs etc.  Historically we configure those resources with system gid.  And that wouldn\u0027t be the best apparently.",
